      "content": "thanks for that. so when u mention the partition plan and the rejection of it, is that seen as the main turning point? it feels like a lot of sources talk about that as the definite moment where everything went wrong. can u elaborate on how that specifically shaped the legitimacy of the claims for both sides?",
